      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Plenty of strong form lines converge. ITALIAN SPIRIT (1) led for the judge then gave a kick and was too good in a 1400m maiden over 1400m at Kembla last start. Out of an Oaks winner so the extra 200m today can only help. Should bowl along in front and give them something to catch again. PERINI MISS (4) led from the outset and toyed with a maiden field over 1500m at this track last time out. Promising mare with more to offer at just the third run of the campaign. LEGASELLI (7) won her maiden two back over this distance at Kembla. Pulled up in a bad way last start so put a line through that run. In the right race to bounce back to form. AUTUMN SKY (3) didn't do a great deal first-up over 1300m at the Illawarra Grange but will enjoy the longer journey this afternoon.",
